{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2268140/extras/8052e1c1b061aa32fbfed08885299e1b.avif?t=1760230539\" width=529 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mental: The Dark Night</strong> is a <strong>horror</strong> and <strong>exploration</strong> game powered by <strong>Unreal Engine 5</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Step into the role of an employee of a company dedicated to researching paranormal events, called <strong>Mental</strong>. You will have your own office, with the possibility of even creating your own living space within Mental\u2019s facilities.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main idea of <i><strong>Mental: The Dark Night</strong></i> is to provide you with an immersive visual and audio experience, designed to make you feel as realistic as possible while going through psychological adventures. <strong>New stories and new exploration maps will be released regularly</strong>, each offering different experiences, all centered around psychological horror. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2268140/extras/17854d7999c8a40d3c449e529254fb6d.poster.avif?t=1760230539\" width=554 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2268140/extras/17854d7999c8a40d3c449e529254fb6d.webm?t=1760230539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2268140/extras/17854d7999c8a40d3c449e529254fb6d.mp4?t=1760230539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mental features <u>different stories and exploration maps</u>, referred to as <u>contracts</u>. At headquarters, you\u2019ll find the planning room with several monitors, including the main monitor and another that provides access to a museum. These monitors allow you to access Mental\u2019s data, your personal information, and available modes. Each monitor runs its own operating system, which will receive updates over time.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2268140/extras/44669a27fd979e9c048a0fbc16502473.avif?t=1760230539\" width=554 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The headquarters is the central hub, where you can access training, available modes, and your employee information. Over time, you\u2019ll see changes in the headquarters, as it gets updated just like all contracts.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each time you complete a contract, you will level up. Your level can be viewed at headquarters on a separate monitor. Levels are used to unlock more contracts and additional items.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2268140/extras/2f100aef02f49d19b1bd57b6a30861ad.avif?t=1760230539\" width=1560 height=542 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each map contains hidden rewards and collectibles. Try to obtain them to store at headquarters and to unlock Steam Achievements.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2268140/extras/c17ebaed91bff7f2bc965224fdbe32c0.avif?t=1760230539\" width=554 height=104 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Puzzle Solving</u>: </strong><i>Throughout your adventure, in every contract you choose, you will encounter puzzles that must be solved to progress. These range from simple riddles to more complex challenges requiring observation and logic.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2268140/extras/bd892a9eeda2fc1b1b2658a4ece5161d.avif?t=1760230539\" width=1423 height=317 /></span> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Exploration</u>:</strong> <i>Players must explore different environments such as abandoned houses, hospitals, and other dark and mysterious places. Exploration is key to progressing through the stories.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2268140/extras/55c1dc1572446c551cadff354d6433e8.avif?t=1760230539\" data-has-big width=800 height=206 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Resource Management</strong></u>: <i>You\u2019ll need to carefully manage your resources, such as batteries for your flashlight or video camera, along with other useful items you find along the way.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2268140/extras/4c9f24a2851247617f1c5c1c410f673f.avif?t=1760230539\" data-has-big width=800 height=216 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Stealth and Evasion</strong></u><strong>: </strong><i>Facing threats directly is not always the best choice. Often, you\u2019ll need to use stealth to avoid being detected by paranormal entities and other dangers.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2268140/extras/e758bd24a02531a305d30b6986991248.avif?t=1760230539\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Environmental Interaction</strong></u><strong>:</strong> <i>You can interact with various objects in the environment to gather information, unlock new areas, or trigger specific events.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2268140/extras/9d8ba771eb1e1435720e011bd880fcfd.avif?t=1760230539\" data-has-big width=800 height=254 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mental also features an online mode. Online mode lets you explore maps or play mini-games, either with friends or on public servers.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mental: The Dark Night</strong> has been in development since 2019. At this stage, the basic framework (skeleton) of Mental is already built. The project is being developed by a single independent creator, with additional content acquired from the Epic Games Unreal Engine Marketplace.<br>Currently, the focus is on developing the story, interactions, techniques, maps, and more. <br> <br><i>All news and updates will mainly be published here on this Steam page and on social media.</i></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2268140?t=1760230539","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2268140/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760230539","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2268140/40281491c485153a7371132ee97c168db2aec752/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760230539","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2268140/40281491c485153a7371132ee97c168db2aec752/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760230539","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2268140/extras/8052e1c1b061aa32fbfed08885299e1b.avif?t=1760230539\" width=529 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mental: The Dark Night</strong> is a <strong>horror</strong> and <strong>exploration</strong> game powered by <strong>Unreal Engine 5</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Step into the role of an employee of a company dedicated to researching paranormal events, called <strong>Mental</strong>. You will have your own office, with the possibility of even creating your own living space within Mental\u2019s facilities.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main idea of <i><strong>Mental: The Dark Night</strong></i