re_item_assets/steam/apps/2268140/extras/9d8ba771eb1e1435720e011bd880fcfd.avif?t=1760230539\" data-has-big width=800 height=254 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mental also features an online mode. Online mode lets you explore maps or play mini-games, either with friends or on public servers.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mental: The Dark Night</strong> has been in development since 2019. At this stage, the basic framework (skeleton) of Mental is already built. The project is being developed by a single independent creator, with additional content acquired from the Epic Games Unreal Engine Marketplace.<br>Currently, the focus is on developing the story, interactions, techniques, maps, and more. <br> <br><i>All news and updates will mainly be published here on this Steam page and on social media.</i></h2>","developers":["Merlon"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2268140/585ea76de4504e6559fb002a12796e8c2c8b649b/header.jpg?t=1760230539","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SOUNDTRACK</h2><br><i>Dark Piano, vol. I Music Pack - <strong>Aleksis Shaw Music</strong></i><br><i>Victorian Psychological Horror Music Pack - <strong>Aleksis Shaw Music</strong></i><br><i>Orchestra of the Occult Music Pack - <strong>Aleksis Shaw Music</strong></i><br><i>Exclusive Album - <strong>Lilbru</strong></i>  <strong>|</strong>  <i><u>Soundtrack in DLC</u></i><br><i>Distorted Piano Soundtrack Bundle - <strong> Ada Maskil </strong></i><br><i>Only Pianos - <strong>SD Soundtracks</strong></i><br><i>Surface - Atmospheres & Ambiences - <strong>Magmi.Soundtracks</strong></i><br><i>Abandoned Souls - Dark & Haunting Ambiences - <s